{"page":238,"verses":[{"verse_key":"12:23","surah":12,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"وَرَٰوَدَتْهُ ٱلَّتِى هُوَ فِى بَيْتِهَا عَن نَّفْسِهِۦ وَغَلَّقَتِ ٱلْأَبْوَٰبَ وَقَالَتْ هَيْتَ لَكَ ۚ قَالَ مَعَاذَ ٱللَّهِ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ رَبِّىٓ أَحْسَنَ مَثْوَاىَ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ لَا يُفْلِحُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The woman in whose house he was living tried to seduce him: she bolted the doors and said, ‘Come to me,’ and he replied, ‘God forbid! My master has been good to me; wrongdoers never prosper.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَرَٰوَدَتْهُ","en_gloss":"And sought to seduce him","transliteration":"warāwadathu","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"she who","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"he (was)","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيْتِهَا","en_gloss":"her house","transliteration":"baytihā","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نَّفْسِهِۦ","en_gloss":"his self","transliteration":"nafsihi","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَغَلَّقَتِ","en_gloss":"And she closed","transliteration":"waghallaqati","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَبْوَٰبَ","en_gloss":"the doors","transliteration":"l-abwāba","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَقَالَتْ","en_gloss":"and she said","transliteration":"waqālat","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هَيْتَ","en_gloss":"Come on","transliteration":"hayta","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَكَ ۚ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"laka","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَعَاذَ","en_gloss":"I seek refuge in Allah","transliteration":"maʿādha","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"I seek refuge in Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"12:23"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِنّ